# Digital Collections, Digital Libraries and the Digitization of Cultural Heritage Information.

**Authors:** Lynch, Clifford

## Abstract
Discusses the development of digital collections and digital libraries. Topics include digitization of cultural heritage information; broadband issues; lack of compelling content; training issues; types of materials being digitized; sustainability; digital preservation; infrastructure; digital images; data mining; and future possibilities for digital libraries. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ656089

